## 6. Kab kaunsa tool chahiye

| Halat                                                          | Kya chahiye                                                                                           |
|:---------------------------------------------------------------|:------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Ek ya do pcap files hain, aur ek-ek packet dekhna hai          | **Wireshark**                                                                                         |
| Pcap files se jaldi summary chahiye (IPs, ports, HTTP requests) | **Zeek**                                                                                              |
| Bahut saari pcap files (date 10, 18, 25...), browser me search karni hain | **Arkime** (+ Elasticsearch)                                                                |
| Lakhon logs ko search aur graph me dekhna hai                  | **Elasticsearch + Kibana**                                                                            |
| Sab kuch ek saath, tayyar setup                                | **Malcolm** (Zeek, Arkime aur OpenSearch ko jodta hai). Isme pcap upload karne ke tareeke uske docs me dekhna |






