- check docker is working or not  
      docker --version

- pull the zeek images
      docker pull zeek/zeek:lts

- Go to destination path and create Directory, and 
    cd C:\Users\P\Desktop\pcappapa\merged_output
    mkdir zeek_10_hp1
    docker run --rm -v "${PWD}:/data" -w /data/zeek_10_hp1 zeek/zeek:lts zeek -C -r /data/10_cdac_hp_1.pcap

  
     Hissa                                                            	Matlab
     --rm	                                                     Kaam ke baad container hata do
     -v "${PWD}:/data"	                                       Aapka merged_output folder container ke andar /data bana do
     -w /data/zeek_10_hp1	                                     Zeek ko is folder me chalao (logs yahin banenge)
     zeek -r /data/10_cdac_hp_1.pcap	                         Zeek ko ye pcap padhne ko kaho
     -C	                                                       Checksum 

 Note:  -C kyun: Aapke Wireshark me Checksum: ... [unverified] dikha tha. Computer apni network card se capture karne par aksar checksum galat dikhta hai (hardware offload).
 Zeek by default aise packets ko kharab maan kar chhod deta hai. -C laga kar wo sab packets le leta hai.


NOTE: An file is created "zeek_10_hp1" in which data like .. conn.log, weird.log, aur agar traffic ho to http.log, dns.log created..

