Question: kaun sa IP sabse zyada aaya top 20 ips

docker run --rm -v "${PWD}:/data" -w /data zeek/zeek:lts sh -c "cat conn.log | zeek-cut id.orig_h | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -20"


Command: conn.log se top 20 sabse active source IPs nikalna

