Question: Kaun se ports par attack hua (id.resp_p)

docker run --rm -v "${PWD}:/data" -w /data zeek/zeek:lts sh -c "cat conn.log | zeek-cut proto id.resp_p | grep -v '^icmp' | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -20"

Note:

id.resp_p = honeypot ka port (jis par connection aaya).
Maine saath me proto bhi liya, taaki dikhe ki ye tcp ka port hai ya udp ka (22 TCP aur 22 UDP alag cheez hain).
grep -v '^icmp' ICMP ko hata deta hai. Ye zaroori hai, neeche wajah hai.

"ICMP ki ek chhoti jaal (gotcha): ICMP me port hota hi nahi. Zeek id.orig_p me ICMP ka type aur id.resp_p me code daalta hai. Ping (echo request) ka type 8, code 0, to conn.log me id.resp_p = 0 dikhta hai. 
Isko "port 0" mat samajhna. Isiliye ports ginte waqt ICMP hata dete hain."


Question: Connection kaise khatam hue (conn_state)

docker run --rm -v "${PWD}:/data" -w /data zeek/zeek:lts sh -c "cat conn.log | zeek-cut conn_state | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn"

Note: Yahan head nahi lagaya, kyunki conn_state ki values kam hoti hain, sab dikh jayengi.

Values ka matlab (Zeek ke docs ke hisaab se):

+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| Value     | Matlab                                       | Honeypot me                        |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| S0        | SYN gaya, koi jawab nahi mila                | Scan, jawab nahi                   |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| REJ       | SYN ke jawab me RST aaya                     | Band port par scan                 |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| RSTOS0    | Scanner ne SYN ke baad RST bheja, honeypot   | Scan ka ek tareeka                 |
|           | ka SYN-ACK nahi dikha                        |                                    |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| S1        | Connection bana, abhi tak khatam nahi hua    | Baatcheet shuru hui                |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| SF        | Normal connection, theek se khatam           | Asli baatcheet (ya UDP ka jawab)   |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| RSTO      | Connection bana, scanner ne RST se toda      | Scanner ne port khula paya aur     |
|           |                                              | chhod diya                         |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| RSTR      | Connection bana, honeypot ne RST se toda     | Honeypot ne tod diya               |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| S2 / S3   | Ek taraf se band karne ki koshish, dusri     | Adhoora band hona                  |
|           | taraf jawab nahi                             |                                    |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| RSTRH     | Honeypot ka SYN-ACK aur RST dikha, scanner   | Capture beech me shuru hua         |
|           | ka SYN nahi                                  |                                    |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| SH / SHR  | SYN ke baad FIN, par handshake poora nahi    | Half-open scan                     |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
| OTH       | Shuru ka SYN dikha hi nahi, beech ka traffic | ICMP (ping) me aksar yahi dikhta   |
|           |                                              | hai                                |
+-----------+----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------+






















